1. Herdr shipped mods (Apache License, Version 2.0; https://herdr.dev)
   The following mods are modified copies of mods that ship with Herdr. Each
   modified main.js starts with a notice naming the original mod:
     mods/agents-tr          from "agents"
     mods/files-tr           from "files"
     mods/menu-tr            from "menu"
     mods/new-menu-tr        from "new-menu"
     mods/spaces-tr          from "spaces"
     mods/tabs-tr            from "tabs"
     mods/workspace-chrome-tr from "workspace-chrome"
     mods/workspace-status-tr from "workspace-status"
   Changes: Turkish/English user interface, redesigned footer and status bar,
   translated menus, panel buttons limited to panels in the layout, and a fix for
   PowerShell quote handling in the files panel.

